Refresh shell:				exec $SHELL

Add user to group:			gpasswd -a <user> <group>
Remove user from group:			gpasswd -d <user> <group>

List mounts:				findmnt
Get partition UUIDs:			blkid
Check efibootmgr entries:		efibootmgr

Recursively search for term in dir:	grep -r '<term>' .

Extract .zst:				zstd -d <file>

Get CPU info:				lscpu
Get kernel version:			uname -r
Get graphics card name:			lspci | grep -iE "vga|3d|display"
List monitors in Hyprland:		hyprctl monitors

Update Gentoo repo:			emaint sync -a
Upgrade system:				emerge -uUD @world
Remove package:				emerge -c <pkg>
Clean source files:			eclean [-d] distfiles
Fix updated config files:		dispatch-conf
Update system with new config:		emerge --config <pkg>

List active ebuild repos:		portageq repos_config /
Add a new ebuild repo:			eselect repository enable <repo> [git|rsync] [uri]

List installed packages:		qlist -IRv

See USE flags applied to package:	equery uses <pkg>
See active USE flags:			emerge --info | grep ^USE
See package owning file:		equery belongs <path>

Generate Gentoo package manifest:	ebuild <name>.ebuild manifest

List loaded kernel modules:		lsmod
Regenerate Dracut for current kernel:	dracut -f --kver $(uname -r)
Regenerate GRUB config:			grub-mkconfig -o /boot/grub/grub.cfg

See OpenRC services:			rc-status
Start OpenRC service:			rc-service [-U] <serv> start
Enable OpenRC service:			rc-update [-U] add <serv> <default|boot|...>
Disable OpenRC service:			rc-update [-U] del <serv> <default|boot|...>

View firewall rules:			nft list ruleset

Reload AutoFS config:			/etc/init.d/autofs reload

Export public key:			gpg --armor --export <id>

List fonts:				fc-list
Refresh fonts:				fc-cache -fv
